{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>據《WIRED》記者 Julian Chokkattu 報道，Apple 計劃在今年稍後推出的軟件更新中，為 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/tag/iPhone-Duo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 加入 Reachability 功能。文章推測該功能會在內螢幕與外螢幕同時提供，但未有明確說明。</p>\n\n\n<h2>Reachability 屬輔助使用設定</h2>\n\n\n<p>Reachability 屬輔助使用設定，目前已見於其他 iPhone 型號。用戶在螢幕底部邊緣向下滑動，介面上半部便會下移，令畫面上的控制項更容易以單手觸及。至於今年稍後更新的具體日期，以及在內、外螢幕上的實際運作方式，報道未提供進一步細節。</p>\n\n\n<figure><img alt=\"與 iPhone Duo 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/iphone-duo-standby.webp\"/></figure>\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/guide/iphone/iph145eba8e9/ios\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">消息來源</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.526119+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":263,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:52:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_hash":"d07d6f8ffd96e84161680048e7774a326ca250d912ae957cedd1160bcfab041f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}